          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "morada is built on morar 'to live, to dwell', which is inherited from Latin morārī 'to linger, to stay' (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
